<title>USA: Albertson's June same-store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Albertson's June same-store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albertson's Inc said Monday that total sales for the month ended June 26 increased 4.3 percent, but same-store sales fell by 2.2 percent.</p>
<p>It said that its Denver division benefited from a strike that hurt two of its competitors during the second quarter.</p>
<p>Total sales figures for June were not immediately available. Albertson's is one of the larger retail food-drug chains in the U.S.</p>
</text>
